        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8050W, Waverly Knobset with Regular Round Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Waverly Knob with Round Rosette is a classic and a favorite. It's traditional style makes it a great choice for historic homes. The Waverly Knobset with Regular Round Rose is available in dummy, passage, or privacy functions. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from a huge selection of the top finish colors in the design world. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/keyed-entry-waverly-knob-with-matching-rose-emtek-5100w\"><b>Keyed Waverly Knob with Regular Rose</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditional Half Round Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li> Knob is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass knob and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Waverly Knob and Round Regular Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Stem: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-10-Finish.jpg?v=1704354500\" width=\"600\" height=\"77\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Waverly Knob with Round Rosette",
                "description": "The Waverly Knob with Round Rosette is a classic and a favorite. It's traditional style makes it a great choice for historic homes. The Waverly Knobset with Regular Round Rose is available in dummy, passage, or privacy functions.  It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from a huge selection of the top finish colors in the design world.",
                "keywords": "Emtek Waverly Door Knobs, Emtek Waverly Knob with Regular Rosettes, EMT-8050W, Emtek 8050W, Emtek 8100W, Emtek 8200W, Waverly Door Knob with Round Roses, Waverly Knobset with Regular Round Roses, Traditional half round Shaped Knobs, traditional knobs, classic knobs, Waverly Knob and Round Regular Roses,"
